        "AbstractText": "MDMA, better known as the recreational drug \"ecstasy,\" is well known for stimulating a feeling of closeness and empathy in its users. We advocate that exploring its mechanism of action could lead to new treatments for psychiatric conditions characterized by impairments in social behavior."
